					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "LOG\n\nThe Log node can be used to compute the logarithm of the input(x) with a given base(y). This can be usefull in all sorts of mathematical patches or to simply make a nice curve in a pattern like in the patch below.\n\nIn the example patch we compute the log of the Linear node using a base of 10. this is used to modulate the Y position of the circles."
					}
				},
